  "caption": "Dinh et al. 2024 Lab Chip 24, 913\u2013923, Fig. 2B, 4th panel (the outlet end; the panel's 50 \u00b5m bar, 46.91 px; the image's rotation 0.51\u00b0, from the post columns) with the edges of the figure-aligned mask dinh2024_v1_figure_aligned: the last five post rows and the outlet stretch (65.4 \u00b5m straight from the last gap's centre, then 14.5\u00b0 per side).  Registration: scale from the bar, rotation measured on the image; translation fitted on features and, independently, by chamfer matching (they agree within 0.2 / 0.1 px along / across).  Nearest-outline offset: median 0.57 \u00b5m, 90th percentile 1.58 \u00b5m (n 5106); for comparison 1.82 \u00b5m with the mask shifted half a pitch along and 4.18 \u00b5m with it shifted 5 \u00b5m across.  Over every eligible sample: the metric found an outline for 99.5 % of the 5133 eligible samples (coverage 0.995); censored null ratios 3.46 (half a pitch) and 7.03 (5 \u00b5m across); chamfer null ratios 2.56 and 3.32.  On the image (dark-line centres, \u00b5m at the bar): post pitch 45.08 (mask 45.1); post columns 106.1 apart (mask 106.0); outer walls 247.7 (mask 247.9); centre 52.4 (printed 52); sides 44.1 / 43.9 (printed 44).",
